<title>USA: Group cuts stake in Cliffs Drilling.</title>
<headline>Group cuts stake in Cliffs Drilling.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group led by Appalosa Management L.P. said Monday it cut its stake in Cliffs Drilling Co to 605,000 common shares, or 10.13 percent of the total outstanding, from 825,000 shares or 11.14 percent.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, the group said it sold 205,000 common shares, including 190,850 shares between Nov. 6 and 19 at prices ranging from $40.03 to $50.22 a share.</p>
</text>
